sentences.l:
if without me and Athena the spoil-driver,
Hera, Hermes, and lord Hephaestus,
of steep Ilios he shall spare,

For already the earth-holder, the earth-shaker,
has gone to the heavenly brine, avoiding steep
anger of ours;

sentences.t:
οὐκ ἀΐεις ὅ με νηυσὶν ἔπι πρυμνῇσιν Ἀχαιῶν
οὓς ἑτάρους ὀλέκοντα βοὴν ἀγαθὸς βάλεν Αἴας
χερμαδίῳ πρὸς στῆθος, ἔπαυσε δὲ θούριδος ἀλκῆς;

sentences.l:
such a helper for you the son of Cronus
from Ida has sent, to stand by and ward off,
Phoebus Apollo of the golden sword,
